{"detail": {"templateUuid": "108bbca092964ddfa1e73bf1bcda2926", "projectUuid": "7d0df735c8cb4ea0b58c9c02ae160c00", "name": "你知道 \"中国\" 二字最早写在哪里吗？", "description": "不是史书，不是竹简，而是刻在这件 3000 年前的西周青铜器上。\n1:1 还原宝鸡青铜器博物院镇院之宝何尊，一镜到底穿越三千年：从 1963 年破土而出，到西周工匠的炉火铸造，再到 1975 年铭文被发现的震撼瞬间。\n没有戏说，没有杜撰，所有细节 100% 匹配考古报告。当那四个字缓缓浮现，我才明白什么叫刻在血脉里的根。", "coverUrl": "/assets/52f57a8b96d66065.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/0c8bad1646dd40ad8d55d1ff6e289ccd/b9cd1e9f1d1d1ea388ade1010012e885a64c60a9.mp4", "snapshotId": 16186, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 1013912, "ownerUuid": "0c8bad1646dd40ad8d55d1ff6e289ccd", "avatar": "/assets/eb8ebab2085a071e.webp", "nickname": "小团长安铺子", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 21, "tags": [{"id": 3036, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "AI漫剧精卫计划", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3036/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3038, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "2-国风非遗专项", "parentTag": 3036, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3036/3038", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1501, "code": "humanity_science", "tagLabel": "人文科普", "parentTag": 1500, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1500/1501/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "http://xhslink.com/o/8MFouyGdVdb", "createAt": "2026年06月02日 16:00", "updateAt": "2026年06月05日 21:04", "publishAt": "2026年06月02日 16:00", "playCount": 7, "viewCreationProcessCount": 0, "copyCanvasCount": 0, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/108bbca092964ddfa1e73bf1bcda2926.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 27, "edges": 9}}, "recommendList": []}